      "id": "claim_22ea060859f04dbf86534ae7e21c50b6",
      "statement": "PRISM Payments Hub (PPH) implements the Kafka integration backbone by publishing payment lifecycle events on Confluent Kafka topics, including pay.wire.lifecycle.v2 (WireLifecycleEvent v2.3, Avro, 7-day retention) and pay.ach.lifecycle.v1 (ACH lifecycle events, 7-day retention), rather than requiring consumers to poll PPH's status APIs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/pph-api-cat-2026.3-prism-payments-hub-api-and-event-catalog.md#L106-L115",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:af80132e90803c86c77f75d5b8602dc1909e9c680bc61de738886db890e17c08:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d3038c7ff5bc49fa984d9fed0249ecf9",
      "statement": "Onboarding a new consumer to a PPH payment-lifecycle Kafka topic requires a consumer ACL requested via PPH Jira and, for Avro-schema topics, schema-registry access, with a lead time of roughly three weeks.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/pph-api-cat-2026.3-prism-payments-hub-api-and-event-catalog.md#L108-L112",
