      "id": "claim_9dd8216c3339423b9e3480cc134c80b8",
      "statement": "The Status Projection Service (SPS) is the reference pattern for consuming payment lifecycle events off the Kafka backbone: a Kafka consumer populates a Postgres read model exposed via a REST API, with new payment types added by configuration and a mapping module; the ARB reaffirmed SPS as the reference pattern for client-facing status of any payment type.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/arb-pay-reg-2026q3-payments-arb-adr-register-and-minutes.md#L67-L68",
